        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-differential-adhesion-sorting-audit-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-4> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 5.48e-01 .

