<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Steinberg (1963, 1970) & Graner-Glazier (1992) differential adhesion cell sorting — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions correspond to interfacial tension formulas and Cellular Potts updates, and `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_041_differential_adhesion_sorting.lean` proves 4 theorems, but v1 docstrings lack equation-by-equation mappings to Graner & Glazier (1992) Eqs. 1-3, Glazier & Graner (1993) Table I, and Foty et al. (1996) Table 1." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
