        "1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py L221–L229: CLI parser only accepts --self-test <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L221-L229>" ;
